From: Armada <noreply@armada>
Subject: [PATCH] steamcompmgr: don't count repeated buffers as app frames

Gamescope already drops a commit that repeats a queued buffer, unless the
commit asks for presentation feedback. Waydroid's hwcomposer asks for it on
every commit, and can commit a display's current buffer again when Android
presents another display. Each of those repeats reached mangoapp as a new
app frame: in Lepton a 60 fps Android game showed up to 270 fps with a
second screen.

Keep those commits for their feedback, but only report a new buffer as an
app frame.
---
diff --git a/src/steamcompmgr.cpp b/src/steamcompmgr.cpp
--- a/src/steamcompmgr.cpp
+++ b/src/steamcompmgr.cpp
@@ -8525,11 +8525,16 @@ void update_wayland_res(CommitDoneList_t *doneCommits, steamcompmgr_win_t *w, Re
 
 	static bool bMangoappSocketDisable = env_to_bool( getenv( "GAMESCOPE_MANGOAPP_SOCKET_DISABLE" ));
 
+	// A buffer that is still queued is the same frame sent again, kept only
+	// for its presentation feedback, as Waydroid's hwcomposer can send it.
+	// Don't count it as a new app frame.
+	const bool bNewAppFrame = !already_exists;
+
 	// Only send the legacy stream while an untagged mangoapp is there to drain it.
 	const bool bHasLegacyReader = !GetBackend()->UsesVirtualConnectors() || has_legacy_mangoapp_reader();
 	const bool mango_nudge = pCurrentFocus && ( ( w == pCurrentFocus->focusWindow && !w->isSteamStreamingClient ) ||
 								( pCurrentFocus->focusWindow && pCurrentFocus->focusWindow->isSteamStreamingClient && w->isSteamStreamingClientVideo ) )
-								&& !bMangoappSocketDisable && bHasLegacyReader;
+								&& !bMangoappSocketDisable && bHasLegacyReader && bNewAppFrame;
 
 	// The window's own connector, not whichever one is current.
 	global_focus_t *pUpscaleFocus = GetFocusForWindow( w );
@@ -8537,7 +8542,7 @@ void update_wayland_res(CommitDoneList_t *doneCommits, steamcompmgr_win_t *w, Re
 	// Typed stream of the window's own connector, only while a tagged
 	// mangoapp is there to drain it.
 	uint32_t uMangoMsgType = 0;
-	if ( !bMangoappSocketDisable )
+	if ( !bMangoappSocketDisable && bNewAppFrame )
 	{
 		global_focus_t *pMangoFocus = nullptr;
 		if ( pUpscaleFocus && !w->isSteamStreamingClient )
